msgid "开始"
msgstr "Start"

msgid "教程"
msgstr "Tutorials"

msgid "用户指南"
msgstr "User guide"

msgid "参考"
msgstr "Reference"

msgid "开发者"
msgstr "Developer"

msgid "OpenPINN 文档"
msgstr "OpenPINN Documentation"

msgid "OpenPINN 是一个可安装、可扩展的 PyTorch PINN 与神经算子工具箱。第一次使用时， 按下面三步即可从文档走到本地训练："
msgstr "OpenPINN is an installable, extensible PyTorch toolbox for PINNs and Neural Operators. Follow these three steps to move from the documentation to local training:"

msgid ":doc:`安装 OpenPINN <install>`。"
msgstr ":doc:`Install OpenPINN <install>`."

msgid "打开 :doc:`方法配置器 <method_configurator>`，选择问题、模型与训练参数。"
msgstr "Open the :doc:`Method Configurator <method_configurator>` and select a problem, model, and training parameters."

msgid "下载配置器生成的可训练 ``.py`` 脚本，在本地 Python 环境运行。"
msgstr "Download the trainable ``.py`` script generated by the configurator and run it in your local Python environment."

msgid "配置器只生成和下载代码，不在浏览器中训练或上传数据。完成第一条本地脚本后， 可继续阅读 :doc:`配置器教程 <configurator_tutorial>`、:doc:`代码教程 <code_tutorials>`， 或从 :doc:`使用者说明书 <user_guide>` 进入完整建模流程。"
msgstr "The configurator only generates and downloads code; it neither trains in the browser nor uploads data. After your first local script, continue with the :doc:`Configurator tutorial <configurator_tutorial>`, :doc:`Code tutorials <code_tutorials>`, or the complete workflow in the :doc:`User guide <user_guide>`."

msgid "5--20 步短训练只检查代码和输出是否正常，不是精度结论。正式比较应固定问题、 网络、训练点、步数和随机种子，每次只改变一个方法组件。"
msgstr "A 5--20 step run only checks that code and outputs work; it is not an accuracy result. For formal comparisons, hold the problem, network, training points, steps, and random seed fixed, and change one method component at a time."

msgid "本站由 Sphinx 和 ``sphinx_rtd_theme`` 生成，提供左侧目录、全文搜索、代码复制、 API 索引以及每种方法的论文、许可、对比结果和已知限制。"
msgstr "This site is built with Sphinx and ``sphinx_rtd_theme`` and provides sidebar navigation, full-text search, code copying, an API index, and papers, licenses, comparisons, and known limitations for each method."
